    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">• Screenshots stay in memory; they are never saved or uploaded.\n• OCR and offline translation run on your device.\n• No text goes online unless you enable a translation server yourself.\n• The app captures nothing until you tap the bubble.\n• Apps that block screen capture will appear black; TARJUMAN does not try to bypass this.\n• History is local and can be deleted from the History page.</string>
